a natural and immersive learning experience while maintaining awareness of the surrounding environment.\n\nKey Features\n\n\u2022 Mixed Reality-based CPR training\n\u2022 AED education and emergency response training\n\u2022 Seamless integration of virtual training content with the real environment\n\u2022 Intuitive hand-based interaction\n\u2022 Designed for schools, hospitals, emergency services, and corporate safety training\n\u2022 Repeatable training sessions that enhance learning effectiveness\n\nReaLive MR enhances conventional CPR education by providing a safe, immersive, and highly interactive training environment that helps learners develop practical life-saving skills and emergency response capabilities.\n\nDeveloped by TechSan Co., Ltd., ReaLive MR combines advanced Mixed Reality technology with immersive CPR education to deliver realistic and effective emergency response training.", "short_description": "ReaLive MR is a Mixed Reality CPR training solution that enables immersive CPR and AED education using Meta Quest devices."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\ub85c\uace0_\uc228\ud130\uce58 1024_1024.png", "id": "1592341982239556", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_1592341985572889_6947409751023236525_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zZ2UnGxarIgQ7kNvwH0e_qo&_nc_oc=AdqNvWgMVJ8iQcZUAoBxViSeaV_6nJ2wcbCynmhFYhWyr4lgzJG4pAHbtSfu2kW68Sc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNksYWxpWajaH-PtmLr4TGcMgXcF110l51xNomsceu8bg&oe=6AC91B3F"}, {"file_name": "\uc228\ud130\uce58_\ub300\ud45c_3000x900_Safe area.png", "id": "1306835034770003", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_1306835038103336_6820841876092211466_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6BJyXwueLEAQ7kNvwHsPwFi&_nc_oc=Adpb32Lgkz5y51YgyFr7sQf5u8l2S9q6vm999_MGxYIac4f27qlgTNYCK_Fyn6T6DZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-